  "name": "kickstart-modular.nvim",
  "description": "A modularized fork of kickstart.nvim designed as a pedagogical starting point for Neovim configuration. It employs a multi-file architecture using the lazy.nvim plugin manager to organize LSP integration, treesitter-based parsing, and telescope-driven fuzzy finding. The project emphasizes clarity and extensibility while maintaining a lightweight footprint for rapid developer environment bootstrapping.",
